+# Tatá Slings textures
+
+Her fabrics, cropped from the product photos on tataslings.com.br (2026-11-02): fabric only, no
+label, seam, face or hand. 384 × 384 px WebP (quality 78), drawn mirrored at the edges so they
+tile without a seam. © Tatá Slings; used in Cochilo with the owner's permission. Not for other
+apps.
+
+| File | Fabric | Photo |
+|---|---|---|
+| `tex_perola.webp` | Malha Pérola | tata-facil-sling-malha-perola, photo 5 |
+| `tex_rosa_cha.webp` | Dry Fit Rosa Chá | tata-facil-sling-dry-fit-rosa-cha, photo 3 |
+| `tex_capuccino.webp` | Malha Capuccino | tata-facil-sling-malha-capuccino, photo 3 |
+| `tex_mel.webp` | Malha Mel | tata-facil-sling-malha-mel, photo 4 |
+| `tex_trevo.webp` | Malha Trevo | tata-facil-sling-malha-trevo, photo 2 |
+| `tex_cereja.webp` | Dry Fit Cereja | tata-facil-sling-dry-fit-cereja, photo 2 |
+| `tex_crepusculo.webp` | Malha Crepúsculo | tata-facil-sling-malha-crepusculo, photo 10 |
+| `tex_chumbo.webp` | Dry Fit Chumbo | tata-facil-sling-dry-fit-chumbo, photo 6 |
+| `tex_balao.webp` | Malha Balão (print) | tata-facil-sling-malha-balao, photo 5 |
+| `tex_folhagem.webp` | Malha Folhagem (print) | tata-facil-sling-malha-folhagem-estampa-exclusiva, photo 4 |
+| `tex_tropical.webp` | Malha Tropical (print) | tata-facil-sling-malha-tropical, photo 4 |
+
+Rule: a texture is never behind text. Cochilo shows it only as the band of a Fabric frame
+(docs/components.md) and as a picker swatch.
